[44.042253, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8"]
[44.042717, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Create a self-referencing quine cycle across three languages: write quine_cycle.py that, when \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mrun, outputs a Ruby script (quine_cycle.rb) which, when run, outputs a Bash script (quine_cycle.sh) \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mwhich, when run, regenerates the original quine_cycle.py byte-for-byte. Each script should contain a\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[2G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mcomment identifying itself as step 1/2/3 of the cycle. After creating quine_cycle.py, run the full \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mcycle (python3 \u2192 ruby \u2192 bash) and then diff the original and regenerated Python files to prove they \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mmatch. Print all three source files side by side at the end with a banner showing the cycle is \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mcomplete. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll create a self-referencing quine cycle across three languages. This is a complex task, so let me\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kstart by understanding what's needed and then build it incrementally.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(/tmp/ami-demo-TfXI5U) 0.1s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KLet me plan the approach:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K1. \u001b[1mquine_cycle.py\u001b[22m - Outputs quine_cycle.rb\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K2. \u001b[1mquine_cycle.rb\u001b[22m - Outputs quine_cycle.sh\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K3. \u001b[1mquine_cycle.sh\u001b[22m - Outputs quine_cycle.py\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KEach script will encode the source of the next script. The key is using string escaping carefully so\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Keach language can properly generate the next.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KLet me start by creating the Python\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[20G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;248m42 \u00b7 Ctrl+B bg\u001b[39m  \u001b[33m\u26a1auto \u00b7 \u001b[36m\u001b[2m[core] \u001b[39manthropic-vertex/claude-haiku-4-5 \u00b7  8% \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;35m\u25b0\u25b1\u25b1\u25b1\u25b1\u25b1\u25b1\u25b1\u001b[39m\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8\u001b[?2026l"]
